<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>World | Deutsche Welle</title><subtitle type="html">World | Deutsche Welle</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-world</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:22:50Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-world" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-world" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>India's young workers have a new colleague: AI</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d2114fef6d81f43d5db8407f6c73d5c616c541f745a592410f7be15bd77ecd76</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:22:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T11:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-young-workers-have-a-new-colleague-ai/a-79678342--60612fda0623.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-young-workers-have-a-new-colleague-ai/a-79678342?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Artificial intelligence is changing the way Indian workplaces operate — raising questions about productivity, skills and entry-level jobs.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How prepared is Kenya for an Ebola outbreak?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9bab885039fa2cff8cc5bd7622f337fea3a8964a90980e9adc5d2906d423f2db</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:22:24Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T10:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-prepared-is-kenya-for-an-ebola-outbreak/a-79668144--2b6e19c28555.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-prepared-is-kenya-for-an-ebola-outbreak/a-79668144?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The first two confirmed Ebola cases in Kenya have raised urgent questions about the country's public health preparedness and border controls. But the health ministry says there is no need for panic.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Italy cuts air traffic in half amid data transmission issue</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:994d1c75033689cd1ab8433a2eec5fa35b6317da30e1a25087a6c6b6f5cff626</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:22:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T10:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/italy-cuts-air-traffic-in-half-amid-data-transmission-issue/a-79678133--8d0677d89358.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/italy-cuts-air-traffic-in-half-amid-data-transmission-issue/a-79678133?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Citing problems with the data transmission network, Italian authorities have drastically reduced the volume of flights in their airspace. The ENAV authority ruled out malicious activity and said flights remained safe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Starlink: How Elon Musk's company influences geopolitics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:04220ca083801c7ac45b7ce0292f014ade3addde7969c1a62209c616847c8e93</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T05:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/starlink-how-elon-musk-s-company-influences-geopolitics/a-75963477--2578f6b76007.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/starlink-how-elon-musk-s-company-influences-geopolitics/a-75963477?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Designed to bring internet access to remote regions, Elon Musk's Starlink has become vital in crisis regions and war zones. But Ukraine also shows the risks of depending on the service.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Carney implies US trying to 'break' Canada amid vote for Alberta independence referendum</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4069c51ae3d59830bab915c2a79bac690a357ef93c3cd3c0f89ac8cbc4a5a9c4</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:22:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T04:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/carney-implies-us-trying-to-break-canada-amid-vote-for-alberta-independence-referendum/a-79675652--c6d8b1a483f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/carney-implies-us-trying-to-break-canada-amid-vote-for-alberta-independence-referendum/a-79675652?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The oil-rich province of Alberta will vote to decide if it wants to remain a Canadian province or start the legal process toward separation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Police raid the major pro-opposition Halk TV channel in Turkey</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a6fdd6fc4096681432002967fc143468fba104a945706e34d7e3dee0dd47ada5</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T16:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/police-raid-the-major-pro-opposition-halk-tv-channel-in-turkey/a-79671673--402c2b295200.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/police-raid-the-major-pro-opposition-halk-tv-channel-in-turkey/a-79671673?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkish police raided the Istanbul headquarters of an important pro-opposition television station on Wednesdazy, the day that jailed Istanbul Mayor Ekrem Imamoglu was set to start his defense against corruption charges.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Can Kenya preserve the democratic space Raila Odinga fought for?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:421eac6d6c8305b266f07e701d083f5f6bbe2d38b7221ef639bf3e5f500ea709</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T14:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-kenya-preserve-the-democratic-space-raila-odinga-fought-for/a-79668443--9bcf26ba8b3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-kenya-preserve-the-democratic-space-raila-odinga-fought-for/a-79668443?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One year after the former prime minister's death, Kenyans are reflecting on his contribution to democracy and national reconciliation. Odinga's "handshakes" with his political rivals remain the subject of much debate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU summit to focus on China, Ukraine and bloc budget</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1baabcb87f4335edce10dea497117b455eee20fa89617ec93372eeb9459556dc</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338--d6856904c849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">EU leaders meeting in Brussels will examine measures to curb the bloc's huge trade deficit with China. But they will also be looking to further agreement on the next EU budget ahead of some major elections next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Romania: 2 ships on fire in Black Sea, 7 crew missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23a6ac03a9c439d16e2357121babe7422b3fdbe0e520228f15935efa30dbc5ab</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T14:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/romania-2-ships-on-fire-in-black-sea-7-crew-missing/a-79667003--b330bc2c57d8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/romania-2-ships-on-fire-in-black-sea-7-crew-missing/a-79667003?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two chemical tankers have caught fire in Romanian territorial waters in the Black Sea. The blazes occurred after Russian drones were sighted in Romanian airspace.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hypersonic missiles highlight arms race on Korean Peninsula</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0774574e7a3adac6e9f42b9b81dd5bb81812147137ce0655c4fd1f1ef03d5fe4</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hypersonic-missiles-highlight-arms-race-on-korean-peninsula/a-79667084--2f8077093613.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hypersonic-missiles-highlight-arms-race-on-korean-peninsula/a-79667084?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Both South and North Korea have tested weapons feared by military planners for their speed and ability to maneuver in flight.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil's elections matter for the planet. This is why</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e62e733247997fe53abf273b4b1214bf8b0af796cbb38c8f4139fa65aa432626</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T09:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-s-elections-matter-for-the-planet-this-is-why/a-79659928--00329e582e5d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-s-elections-matter-for-the-planet-this-is-why/a-79659928?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazil is heading back to the polls, but the impact could be felt worldwide. With the Amazon vital to the health of the planet, the election could help shape its future.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea, China open border bridge after 12-year delay</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d6578d83227b482b411f0f99a99a73b3c2457745d1fab4a1547e0b3f7662c14b</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112--b02034e8a849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Twelve years after it was constructed, the New Yalu River Bridge between China and North Korea is finally operational. It is the latest sign of warming ties between the two nations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
